<title>USA: Cidco Inc Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Cidco Inc Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>MORGAN HILL, Calif. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						  Three months ended</p>
<p>							March 31,</p>
<p>					  1997			   1996</p>
<p> Sales				$77,030		     $51,686</p>
<p> Cost of sales		     42,783			29,063</p>
<p> Gross margin			34,247			22,623</p>
<p>Operating expenses:</p>
<p>   Research and development     4,060			 3,124</p>
<p>   Selling and marketing	 20,428			 7,263</p>
<p>   General and administrative   2,890			 1,686</p>
<p>     Total operating expenses  27,378			12,073</p>
<p> Income from operations	   6,869			10,550</p>
<p>   Other income, net		  459			   400</p>
<p> Income before income taxes     7,328			10,950</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes     2,931			 4,380</p>
<p> Net income			   4,397			 6,570</p>
<p> Earnings per share		  0.30			  0.44</p>
<p> Weighted average shares	 14,678			15,016</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest Q1 net income includes one-time charges of about $4.9 million, including $4.3 million of inventory charges related to the company's corded, non-speaker phones. First quarter income also reflects expenditures of about $8.7 million on the repurchase of 691,000 shares of common stock.</p>
</text>
